---
interface OutlineSection {
  id: string;
  title: string;
  page: number;
}

interface OutlineMeta {
  title: string;
  page: number;
}

interface Props {
  sourceTitle: string;
  sourceAuthor: string;
  sourceRole: string;
  unitLabel: string;
  sourcePage: number;
  sections: OutlineSection[];
  exercisesPage?: number | null;
  meta?: OutlineMeta[];
}

const {
  sourceTitle,
  sourceAuthor,
  sourceRole,
  unitLabel,
  sourcePage,
  sections,
  exercisesPage = null,
  meta = [],
} = Astro.props;
---

<section class="reading-outline">
  <header class="reading-outline__header">
    <div>
      <p class="reading-outline__eyebrow">{sourceRole}</p>
      <h2>结构状态</h2>
    </div>
    <span class="reading-outline__status">outline · 正文待填充</span>
  </header>

  <dl class="reading-outline__metadata">
    <dt>来源</dt>
    <dd>{sourceAuthor}, <cite>{sourceTitle}</cite></dd>
    <dt>单元</dt>
    <dd>{unitLabel}</dd>
    <dt>起始页</dt>
    <dd>印刷页 {sourcePage}</dd>
  </dl>

  <p>
    本页当前只保留目录级定位、页码与后续内容插槽，不包含教材正文、教材图表、习题原文或答案。
  </p>

  <h2>目录级分节</h2>

  {sections.length > 0 ? (
    <div class="reading-outline__table-wrap">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col">节</th>
            <th scope="col">标题</th>
            <th scope="col">印刷页</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {sections.map((section) => (
            <tr>
              <td><code>{section.id}</code></td>
              <td>{section.title}</td>
              <td>{section.page}</td>
            </tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  ) : (
    <p>原书目录未为本单元列出下一级分节；正文框架仍保留统一内容插槽。</p>
  )}

  {exercisesPage && (
    <p class="reading-outline__supplement">
      原书目录标出的 Exercises 起始页：{exercisesPage}。网站不会转录习题原文。
    </p>
  )}

  {meta.length > 0 && (
    <>
      <h2>实践教材附加入口</h2>
      <ul>
        {meta.map((item) => <li>{item.title}：印刷页 {item.page}</li>)}
      </ul>
    </>
  )}

  <h2>后续内容插槽</h2>

  <ol class="reading-outline__slots">
    <li>本单元阅读定位与前置知识；</li>
    <li>物理对象、符号、单位与边界条件；</li>
    <li>公式推导：定义、严格关系、近似与数值离散分开记录；</li>
    <li>原创示意图或交互模型及其验收标准；</li>
    <li>真实 DFT 派生数据示例、provenance 与收敛边界；</li>
    <li>练习、复盘问题与常见误判。</li>
  </ol>
</section>
